# meta_phalanx_security.oot — Adversarial QA (Security Auditor)
# Date: 2026-08-11
# Role: Security Auditor (Adversarial QA) — path-A metamorphic / meta phalanx
# Scope: ooda/oodac/c_emit_meta.oo + emit wire (c_emit.oo) + runtime meta floor
#        (chs_rt_meta.c / meta_epoch) + residual free-name refuse
# Write locus: this audit file. Code OWN fix: oodac/c_emit_meta.oo only.

---

## Claim under pressure

Path-A metamorphic floor claims:
1. Opt-in `// METAMORPHIC: path-a` inserts non-semantic layout decoys at emit-C.
2. `meta_epoch()` is process-local entropy for future immune hooks.
3. Full DESIGN immune product (continuous RAM re-mutation, ROP graph reshape,
   `metamorphic_emit` / `metamorphic_build`) remains residual refuse.

Adversarial stance: treat decoys as a **gadget factory** until proven inert.

---

