## OWN fix applied

**File:** `/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA/ooda/oodac/c_emit_meta.oo` only.

| Change | Why |
|--------|-----|
| Security contract block in file header | Pin invariants for future emit edits |
| `static` retained; `used,noinline` under GNUC/clang | Keep layout pads without export/fptr |
| Comment block on each decoy: not main, not CFI, no fptrs/exec/fmt | Greppable audit trail in generated C |
| idx clamp `< 0 → 0` + empty-id guard | Well-formed C ident; no user strings |
| `volatile unsigned int` pad only | No sinks, no format, no indirect calls |
| Preserved `c_meta_layout_emit_decoys(mode)` | Multi-pass protos+bodies must not redefine static decoys (C compile break / duplicate .text) |

**Not touched (out of OWN):** `c_emit.oo` (already wires mode gate), runtime, residual checker, std/.

